{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"5b8426c1ac22cf285cb38b347056c0c28b2749ff813a1d431898742586fddce0","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review criterion routing","key_entities":["T13","T14","removal-rationale","asserted-capability","DetGateRule","src/rebar/llm/plan_review/registry.py","src/rebar/llm/plan_review/orchestrator.py","route_criteria","coverage.routing.det_gated","file_impact","_DET_OVERLAY_RULES","_DET_LEAF_GATE_RULES","overlay_triggers","leaf_gate_triggers","det_gate_rules.py","ADR 0034","docs/adr/0034-llm-routed-enumeration-overlays.md"],"problem_keywords":["zero findings","agentic execution waste","deterministic pre-filter","criterion gating","false negatives"],"propositions":["Four overlay and leaf criteria (T13, T14, removal-rationale, asserted-capability) produced zero findings across ~7,900 agentic runs due to missing or insufficiently precise vocabulary triggers.","A deterministic pre-filter gate (DetGateRule with text_all regex conjunctions, file_impact glob patterns, and file_impact_reason_re) must fire before LLM routing; not-fired criteria skip to zero LLM invocations and record skips in coverage.routing.det_gated.","The asserted-capability criterion requires both legs (module-ref AND capability-verb regexes) to fire; single-leg matches must not pass the gate.","T14 and removal-rationale gates must support file_impact path/reason matching independently of plan text, enabling detection of removal or scheduler/workflow changes without descriptive language."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787475026519347001,"uuid":"ed0bcbd6-5692-44